- 2 left (to freeway) Â· 3 both sides + ravine off tee (drop zone 277 yds from green) Â· 4 both sides Â· 5 left Â· 6 canyon off tee Â· 7 left (drop zone 35 yds short of green) and long past back bunker except hole 8's Black tee box Â· 9 left Â· 10 both sides Â· 11 left of fairway and right of cart path, ~20 yds safe left of green (drop zone 57 yds short) Â· 12 right Â· 14 right, 10â€“25 yds room right of green Â· 15 right of cart path Â· 16 right of cart path Â· **brush between 18 and 10 = interior OB** (and brush generally = lost ball).
