## Scene ownership notes (Oct 31)
- Clubhouse (h18i7): the visible clubhouse roof, dining patio (`H18I7/Plaza/DiningPatio`, path layer + GSPconcrete collider), its planters and every reseated part are H18I7 copies (the patio umbrella tables are switched off and recorded); the CLUBHOUSE originals are switched off and recorded in `H18I7/_records`. Later clubhouse edits must target the H18I7 copies (or re-run `TierraApply_h18i7.Apply`, which undoes its own records first).
- Shared rough copies: rough_0_4 uses Rough12Tee_h12tee (h12tee v2) and rough_0_0 uses Rough12Sur_h12sur (h12sur); any later edit to the shared satellite rough material has to be copied into both.
- Hole 6: `FENCES/Fence_13` (tee-side split rail) is switched off on BoJa's word ("There is no fence here along the 6 tee box"), not deleted.

## Data notes
- OSM layers (parking, roads, land use, buildings) came from Overture Maps release 2026-09-23.0 (`ob/scripts/overture_fetch.py`), same OSM data in parquet form.

## Source files worth keeping in the project
`TierraRejada.GKD`, `map (1).osm` (full-course OSM export), `TierraRejada_satellite.jpg`, the CSVs (`tierra_trees`, `fences`, `walls`, `nets`, `cartpaths`), and the `.cs` tools.
